		"Id": "mechdef_shadowhawkiic_SHD-IIC-1",
		"Name": "Shadow Hawk IIC",
		"Details": "The Shadow Hawk IIC is an inexpensive second-line Clan BattleMech based upon the venerable Shadow Hawk design fielded by the Star League, although it weighs in at 45 tons instead of its progenitor's 55 tons. Introduced in the Clan's Golden Century, the Shadow Hawk IIC served with distinction for centuries to come in second-line and garrision clusters. The SHD-IIC-1 is the base model, featuring a 270-rated fusion engine and Endo-Steel and Ferro-Fibrous construction materials for weight saving. It puts the free tonnage towards an effective if unexceptional loadout of 2 Medium Pulse Lasers, 4 Streak SRM-2 launchers, an ER Medium Laser, and an ER Small Laser. 10 DHS cover heat needs and 6 jump jets provide extra lift.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_shadowhawkiic"
	},
